# A road that ends at the flag it started from, drawn with the Road button, gets a carrier; a flag on it splits it into two roads between
# the same two flags, each with a carrier at work.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh road-loop --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10
# On that map the castle stands at 21,4, so its flag is at 22,5. The loop leaves the flag south-east and goes round the node 22,6
# (23,6 23,7 22,7 21,6 21,5) back to 22,5; the flag that splits it goes on 22,7, three steps along.
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 21 4
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 22 5
click-tile 23 6
click-tile 23 7
click-tile 22 7
click-tile 21 6
click-tile 21 5
click-tile 22 5
button Road
wait 0.3
expect-count road = 6
fast-forward carrier state 0x42 max 20000
wait 0.3
shot loop 21 4 5 5
list loop
expect-count carrier = 1

button Flag
click-tile 22 7
button Flag
wait 0.3
expect-at 22 7 flag
shot split 21 4 5 5
list split
wait 40
shot two-carriers 21 4 5 5
list two-carriers
expect-count flag = 2
expect-count carrier = 2
dump after
